      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "JB Kelly brings Doonaree, 172 Howth Road, to the market. The house has been well maintained by its current owners and offers a new buyer the chance to put their own stamp on a substantial family home.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises an entrance porch, a wide hallway with cloakroom and guest WC, an extended living room, a formal dining room that would also work as a fourth bedroom, a lounge, a kitchen dining room, a utility room and a conservatory looking out over the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a generous landing leads to three double bedrooms and a large family bathroom. A fixed staircase brings you up to the attic room, which has a dormer window and an en suite, adding further living and storage space.\r\nThe house is set behind a gated entrance with a wide tarmac driveway and plenty of off-street parking. The front garden is mainly in lawn, bordered by mature hedging with established plants and shrubs.\r\n\r\nThe back garden is the standout. It is large, south-facing, private and gets sun through the day. A paved patio suits outdoor dining, and the rest is well landscaped with mature planting and a good display of flowers and roses.\r\nDoonaree sits in the heart of Sutton, one of North Dublin’s best-known coastal suburbs, on the Howth Road. Sutton Cross is a short walk away, with a good range of shops and local services. Sutton DART station and several Dublin Bus routes give a quick run into the city centre.\r\n\r\nThere is plenty on the doorstep. The house overlooks Sutton Lawn Tennis Club, and sailing, golf and other amenities are close by. Sutton continues to attract families looking for larger houses, good schools and life beside the sea.\r\n\r\nTo arrange a viewing, contact JB Kelly at 01 8393400."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\nPorch\r\nTiled flooring, glazed door to front driveway and garden.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n4.20 x 3.70mSpacious entrance hallway with understair storage.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\n1.50 x 1.40m\r\nWC, wash hand basin, tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n7.05 x 3.55m\r\nExtended living room with open fireplace on raised hearth. Overlooking sunny south facing rear garden. Double doors through to conservatory.\r\n\r\nConservatory\r\n3.20 x 3.05m\r\nBright, light filled room with door leading to the rear garden, sliding door through to…\r\n\r\nFamily Room\r\n4.85 x 4.05m\r\nOpen fireplace with tiled surround.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\n(2.75 x 4.65) + (3.70  x 2.05)\r\nExtensive range of floor and wall mounted presses with tiled splash back. Integrated oven and microwave, ceramic hob with extractor fan over.\r\nBreakfast bar with seating area, sliding patio door to south facing rear garden.\r\nVelux window and recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\n3.75 x 2.75m\r\nDoor to covered side entrance, tiled floor, built-in storage units, fridge freezer\r\n\r\nDining Room / Bedroom 4\r\n3.90 x 4.05m\r\nAttractive room with bow window, decorative coving and ceiling rose. Open fireplace with tiled surround.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding\r\n2.15 x 3.75m\r\nBright and spacious landing area with fixed stair to attic conversion\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n3.95 x 4.95m\r\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property with attractive bow window. Free standing wardrobe and sink.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n4.80 x 4.05m\r\nDouble bedroom overlooking rear garden. Range of built-in wardrobes. Sink.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n3.70 x 3.75m\r\nDouble bedroom overlooking rear garden. Sink.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.00 x 3.70m\r\nWC, wash hand basin, electric shower and chrome heated towel rail.\r\nFully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nAttic Level\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion\r\n(3.25 x 2.20) + (2.70 x 2.70)\r\nAttic room with dormer extension, access to attic storage.\r\nSouth facing rear aspect overlooking gardens towards Sutton Lawn Tennis Club.\r\n\r\nEn suite\r\n1.45 x 1.55m\r\nWC and WHB."
